            "incurred"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "專案在施工期間蒙受了顯著的成本超支。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "By incurring additional debt, the firm risks damaging its credit rating.",
          "highlight": [
            "incurring"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "持續累積額外債務，將危害該公司的信用評等。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "suffer",
        "sustain",
        "accumulate"
